## Backend — Create Area

Implement the minimum application flow for creating an Area.

The flow must follow DESIGN.md.

Conceptually:

Request
  -> validate input
  -> construct Polygon
  -> validate geometry
  -> calculate authoritative area_km2
  -> persist Area
  -> persist AreaVersion(version = 1, change_type = CREATED)
  -> commit
  -> return created Area

Area and initial AreaVersion must be created atomically in one transaction.

If AreaVersion persistence fails, Area persistence must roll back.

Do not trust an area value supplied by the client.

The backend is authoritative for persisted area_km2.

