## REST API

Implement only the Area endpoints required for this prototype.

Review DESIGN.md for the exact API contract.

The prototype needs functionality equivalent to:

POST /workspaces/{workspaceId}/areas

and a viewport query equivalent to:

GET /workspaces/{workspaceId}/areas?bbox=...

Do not invent a different API if DESIGN.md already defines it.

For create:

- accept Area name;
- accept polygon coordinates/geometry according to the documented contract;
- workspaceId comes from the URL;
- calculate area on the backend;
- create AreaVersion 1;
- return the persisted Area representation.

For viewport:

- accept the bounding box according to DESIGN.md;
- query PostgreSQL/PostGIS;
- return ACTIVE Areas intersecting the viewport;
- use ST_Intersects as defined by the design;
- use the existing spatial index.

Do not implement:

- GET Area by ID unless it is required for this prototype;
- PUT;
- DELETE;
- restore;
- history endpoints.

