## Viewport Loading

Persisted Areas must be loaded based on the visible map viewport.

Expected interaction:

Map move/zoom
    ->
determine viewport bbox
    ->
GET Areas for workspace + bbox
    ->
PostGIS ST_Intersects query
    ->
render returned polygons

Do not load every Area from the database and filter on the frontend.

Keep the implementation simple.

Do not introduce caching, pagination, clustering, or debounce complexity
unless already necessary for basic correctness.

